# Usage

Add the `XmlEssentials` package and import `CloudNimble.Text.Xml`. Feed UTF-8 bytes to `Utf8XmlReader` and call `Read` until it returns false.

```csharp
using CloudNimble.Text.Xml;

var reader = new Utf8XmlReader("<Person id=\"1\">Ada</Person>"u8);
while (reader.Read())
{
    // inspect TokenType, LocalNameSpan, ValueSpan
}
```

Construct options with `new XmlReaderOptions()`. A max-* of `0` means the documented default, except `MaxDocumentByteCount`, which stays unbounded.
